'''Kai''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Cyber Academy Galaxy Gals (Gacha Event)|Cyber Academy Galaxy Gals]] or [[AIR BUSTERS (Gacha Event)|AIR BUSTERS]] gacha events. She was added in [[Version 2.2 Update#Version 2.2.6 Update|Version 2.2.6]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 5.9 Update|Version 5.9]] greatly increases her attack power, health, movement speed, and grants [[Immune to Knockback|Knockback Immunity]]. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 10.9 Update|Version 10.9]], and Ultra Talents were added in [[Version 14.2 Update|Version 14.2]].

